OL,3,AHow Breaking Bad's RJ Mitte changed the
OL,4,Away we see cerebral palsy
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I have cerebral palsy but I've never
OL,7,Flet it hold me back."
OL,9,FThose are the words of a 22-year-old
OL,10,FBreaking Bad star RJ Mitte in an essay
OL,11,Ffor Huffpost back in 2014.
OL,13,FExplaining his experiences of learning
OL,14,Fto stand up to bullies while growing
OL,15,Fup, he added: "It shouldn't define you.
OL,16,FI just happen to have CP."
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
