OL,3,AHow Breaking Bad's RJ Mitte changed the
OL,4,Away we see cerebral palsy
OL,5,
OL,6,FThat was also true of Mitte's character
OL,7,FWalter 'Flynn' White Jr, the son of
OL,8,FBryan Cranston's character in the
OL,9,Fdrama, which was recently named the
OL,10,Fbest TV show of the 21st Century by the
OL,11,FNew York Times.
